  "proposition": "Relative occipital (O1) alpha power is higher with the eyes closed than open in 10 of 10 independent eegmmidb subjects (mean drop 0.308) -- Berger's alpha reactivity replicated at group level -- reproduced from 20 frozen substrate runs, with all five band-power claims of the primary (S001 eyes-closed) GROUNDED and a byte-identical replay. Absolute alpha dominance at O1 is not claimed (it holds in 5/10 subjects; several O1 channels are artifact-dominated); the reported, robust quantity is the eyes-closed > eyes-open reactivity.",
